%description:
Tests windowUpdateAfterRead, the window update of Linux after a read
(__tcp_cleanup_rbuf()). The server offers 8000 bytes, and its application reads
only by READ commands (autoRead=false). The client sends 6000 bytes, so 2000
bytes stay open. At t=2 s the application reads 1000 bytes: the receiver can
offer 3000, less than twice the 2000 bytes still open, so no ACK goes. At t=3 s
the application reads 2000 bytes more: the receiver can offer 5000, at least
twice 2000, so an ACK (B008) sends the window at once.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 5s
*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 6000"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1000
*.*_tcp.delayedAcksEnabled = false
*.srv_tcp.advertisedWindow = 8000
*.srv_tcp.windowUpdateAfterRead = true
*.srv_app.autoRead=false
*.srv_app.readScript="2 1000; 3 2000"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.011 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 4001 win 4000 
[1.011 B006] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 5001 win 3000 
[1.011 B007] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 6001 win 2000 
[3.001 B008] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 6001 win 5000 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
The read lets the receiver offer 5000 bytes, where 2000 bytes are open: sending a window update
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%not-contains: stdout
The read lets the receiver offer 3000
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
